  "notes": [
    "The cSUI listing (21237692), its feed pointing at the slot0 adapter (0x8976b5cb, 21237697) and its 95% collateral factor (0xc2402f29, 21237701) are config the exploit needed (rule 8); the collateral factor, latest, sets the age. The comptroller runs the unguarded __setWhitelist__ both attack contracts called.",
    "Anchor components are each market's pre-exploit balance: the 15 WETH and 50 uSUI the attacker supplied and borrowed back are round trips, and uSUI is valued at the attacker's own swap proceeds. USD+ is at par. Remaining DefiLlama marks agree within 0.1% with the attacker's disposals.",
    "Campaign: six later txs (senders 0xcd5e7b69, 0x9dd3850f, 0x012fc637) whitelisted themselves and drained refilled markets, four using cMIGGLES priced by sibling adapter 0x9e331ca8 (same code). Adapter, oracle and markets are unverified; the defects come from bytecode and traces."
